        <li><strong>Pack with flexible elastomeric crack filler:</strong> Press <em>Dr. Fixit Crack-X Paste</em> or <em>Asian Paints SmartCare Crack Seal</em> deep into the V-groove with a putty knife. Slightly overfill the crack to compensate for curing shrinkage. Let dry for 24 hours.</li>
