        <li><strong>Layer 3 (Second Putty Coat):</strong> 1 thin coat of white cement or acrylic putty (0.5 mm thickness) applied horizontally in cross-pattern for glass-like flatness. Let dry for 12 hours, then sand smooth with 180-grit sandpaper. Wipe off all dust thoroughly.</li>
