        <li><strong>"Spilled water on the table left a dark water mark."</strong><br/>The piece was not sealed with enough wax, or the wax had not finished its 7-day cure. Let the water mark dry completely, apply a fresh thin coat of furniture wax, and buff vigorously with a microfiber cloth to restore water repellency.</li>
