          <li><strong>Isolate ceiling electrical circuits before working:</strong> Ceiling fans, recessed LED panel lights, and hidden wiring conduits pass directly through the RCC slab. Water ingress inside electrical conduit pipes can cause catastrophic short circuits or electrocution. Switch off the lighting circuit breaker (MCB) at your distribution board before scraping or applying wet liquids near ceiling electrical boxes.</li>
