      <p>That rancid, nauseating sewage smell that hits you the moment you walk into the kitchen in the morning. The bathroom washbasin that takes three minutes just to drain a handful of water. The floor drain (<em>nahani trap</em>) that gurgles ominously and releases foul odors whenever the shower runs. Drainage clogs and foul pipe odors are among the most frustrating plumbing issues in Indian apartments and independent houses.</p>

