        <li><strong>"The new valve feels loose in the wall socket even after full rotation."</strong><br/>
        The concealed wall elbow threads are worn from decades of fixture changes. Remove the valve, apply 8 to 10 wraps of heavy-duty Teflon tape combined with a smear of plumbing sealant paste, and re-thread firmly.</li>
