      <p>Armed with this clear three-way distinction — <strong>WD-40 for squeaks and rust, M-Seal for wet leaks, and Araldite for broken solid bonds</strong> — you will never hesitate in your utility closet again. You'll complete lasting, professional-quality fixes in minutes with zero wasted product.</p>

