        <li><strong>Heavy Items (6 kg – 20 kg / Bevelled glass mirrors, solid wood frames):</strong> 8mm or 10mm heavy-duty Fischer DuoPower nylon anchors + 5mm x 60mm steel screws (dual points mandatory).</li>
