      <p>That "tip... tip... tip..." sound at 2 AM. The water bill that's mysteriously higher this month. The damp patch spreading under the kitchen sink. A dripping tap or leaking pipe joint isn't just annoying — left alone, it wastes thousands of litres a year and can quietly cause seepage damage to your walls and cabinets. Most of these fixes cost under ₹150 and take 20–30 minutes once you know the process.</p>

